{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You wake up on a decayed island\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no memory of who you are, you begin to explore the island's memories to uncover the truth about yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you find are the tragedies that struck the boys and girls and the mysterious phenomena surrounding this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason you're here, your true identity, and the island's future\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is you who will decide them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is divided into two parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the <strong>Puzzle Part</strong>, where you collect Memory Cores,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the <strong>Novel Part</strong>, where you relive the island's events through the memories stored within those cores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling puzzle action with chain reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit blocks with bullets of the same color. If three or more connect, they explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the path, set off a chain reaction to reach the main core at the deepest point, and grab it to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the number of bullets is limited, plan your moves so the explosions chain efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/29c66b452c85df29bedcab5308aab0f9.poster.avif?t=1757262668\" width=330 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/29c66b452c85df29bedcab5308aab0f9.webm?t=1757262668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/29c66b452c85df29bedcab5308aab0f9.mp4?t=1757262668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the island's story through Memory Cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer the collected cores to the Great Tree to witness the memories of the people involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps items found in the Puzzle Part may awaken hidden memories...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/1c3ce2b72c54d1470dae19709f218580.avif?t=1757262668\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759130?t=1757262668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/c49d7f151e86581a9f839fc7f3255bbdfd20e33e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757262668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/2ee1e25aa97fbceea730b7a27f90fbd27d061b4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757262668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/2ee1e25aa97fbceea730b7a27f90fbd27d061b4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757262668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You wake up on a decayed island\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no memory of who you are, you begin to explore the island's memories to uncover the truth about yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you find are the tragedies that struck the boys and girls and the mysterious phenomena surrounding this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason you're here, your true identity, and the island's future\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_